Tapping a match alert now always opens that match, including a second alert for the same match.

Match reminders survive a phone restart, and tapping one opens the match.

Alerts that arrive late are no longer shown long after the ball was bowled.

Fixed: a home-screen widget that stayed blank after being removed and added again.

Notifications now show the Bouncer icon in the status bar.

New on the Scorecard for big matches: a wagon wheel showing where each batter's runs went.
